BrightPath Studio helps independent professionals write clear service-page content. Its standard package includes a 45-minute discovery call, a first draft, and one revision. It does not include website design, technical setup, or publishing. Using only these supplied facts, identify the three most important points the service page should make clear. Do not claim customer research.
